B.cGb=new A.J("street","Challenge 945: Sold from a window with no door; hunger knows my bell. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A food truck")
B.cEk=new A.J("church","[Set 31] I rise toward heaven yet stand on earth; bells call the faithful to me. What am I?","A steeple")
B.cR_=new A.J("church","[Set 31] Passed hand to hand yet never owned; peace lives in my circle. What am I?","The sign of peace")
B.cRb=new A.J("church","Deep riddle #948 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.cHv=new A.J("church","[Set 31] Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.cMJ=new A.J("church","Challenge 950: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.cR2=new A.J("logic","Deep riddle #951 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I?","A hole")
B.cIM=new A.J("logic","[Set 31] I have cities but no houses, forests but no trees, water but no fish. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A map")
B.cGQ=new A.J("logic","[Set 31] I speak without a mouth and hear without ears; I have no body but come alive with wind. What am I?","An echo")
B.cG3=new A.J("logic","Deep riddle #954 \u2014 Born tall, I die short; every word I carry shrinks me. What am I?","A candle")
B.cP4=new A.J("logic","Challenge 955: I have keys but open no locks; space but no room; enter but not go inside. What am I?","A keyboard")
B.cDz=new A.J("nature","[Set 31] I fall but never get hurt; I blanket the world in white silence. What am I?","Snow")
